  "new_hypothesis": "The board left side has a straight four-cell spine and a two-cell bottom-corner foot; C has exactly these same two boundary runs. Red transfers the four-unit spine and blue the two-unit foot by translation. Predicted errorC accepts a genuine local L-pentomino placement at the corner as evidence that three congruent copies tile the board; they do not.",
